message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "DisInforMeter Demonstrator (DE-CONSPIRATOR Deliverable D5.2)"
abstract: >-
  An interactive, public demonstrator of the DisInforMeter Toolkit: a validated
  population indicator for receptivity to, and detection of, Foreign Information
  Manipulation and Interference (FIMI), developed across five studies and more
  than 10,000 respondents. Visitors can run the complete guided experience
  (19-item receptivity questionnaire, personalised educational feedback,
  behavioural headline-choice task) or inspect the toolkit as a reference
  resource. Receptivity and detection are separate readouts and are never
  combined into a single susceptibility score.
